# --- Roland-derived data is NOT redistributed (copyrighted). Regenerate it locally. ---
#
# This library needs a legally obtained SCCore.dll from a Sound Canvas VA install. Everything
# below is derived from that DLL -- its wave ROM, its tables, or its runtime effect state -- and
# so is not ours to ship. Each line says how to rebuild it.
#
#   tabula-sonora bake-presets <SCCore.dll> <tables-dir> <out.json>   -> Effects/presets.json
#   tabula-sonora extract-tables <SCCore.dll> <out-dir>               -> tables/*.bin
#   scdec revdump / chodump   (TabulaSonora/tools/decoder)            -> tables/*.txt
#
# Rom/manifest.json IS tracked: it is the offset map, not the data.

SCCore.dll
src/TabulaSonora/Effects/presets.json
tables/

# Rendered audio and decoded samples: this is the wave ROM, one step removed.
*.wav
*.flac
*.f32
renders/

# Differential fixtures: sampled outputs over the DLL's own tables, plus parsed third-party MIDI.
tests/TabulaSonora.Tests/fixtures/

# Build output
bin/
obj/
[Bb]uild/
*.user
*.suo

# Editors
.idea/
.vs/
.vscode/

# Python tooling
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Generated documentation (build with: dotnet docfx docs/docfx.json)
docs/_site/
docs/api/
